  "description": "UHF PLL pocket transmitter with lavalier microphone<br>\r\n<br>\r\nA high-quality audio transmission system which offers maximum speech intelligibility:<br>\r\nLavalier microphone CM-501 and pocket transmitter PT-920BG/5. Pilot tone technology, 64 preset channels and a continuously adjustable gain minimise interference during transmission and create a system with a high adaptability. An integrated LCD allows for a quick identification of the battery status and transmission data. A lock function protects against unintentional readjustment of set parameters.<br>\r\nAll instrument microphones of the CX series as well as the headband microphones and lavalier microphones of the CX/CM series can be connected to the PT-920BG/5 without any problems.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nTechnical Details<br>\r\n- Carrier frequency range 518-542 MHz<br>\r\n- Audio frequency range 40-18,000 Hz<br>\r\n- Frequency stability ±0.005 %<br>\r\n- Transmitting power 10 mW<br>\r\n- Connections 4-pole mini XLR<br>\r\n- Power supply 2 x batt. AA size, alkaline<br>\r\n- Operating time > 30 h<br>\r\n- Dimensions 70x190x30 mm (WxHxD)<br>\r\n- Weight 130 g",
